{"event_type":"review","id":"266c2ab1ae56142b7db9c01ecba6887519ad903df88472192346e048e9a99f1d","occurred_at":"2026-11-12T18:10:19Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9aa59068f900f5ae59ab7e198c20048cf3104e5f8b1ded27fd30020d2379dadb","sha256":"9aa59068f900f5ae59ab7e198c20048cf3104e5f8b1ded27fd30020d2379dadb"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5d0146bea5eaa63a2e23b0e84426bce4cfd42c802f9364b57b6b9eecfd58fc2f","sha256":"5d0146bea5eaa63a2e23b0e84426bce4cfd42c802f9364b57b6b9eecfd58fc2f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9d058f182e41aee10ee489a177cb7efef4340e749a03829397ce0eef59a2f283","sha256":"9d058f182e41aee10ee489a177cb7efef4340e749a03829397ce0eef59a2f283"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4fbf18e020597dd36867e15ec9c1d61de3820462cbe7012008b1739e7c13dd3e","sha256":"4fbf18e020597dd36867e15ec9c1d61de3820462cbe7012008b1739e7c13dd3e"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/6c2ec452a2a719ef5f2f750a0123309eae0725ccd817be0efb63d5f77d9435e9","sha256":"6c2ec452a2a719ef5f2f750a0123309eae0725ccd817be0efb63d5f77d9435e9"}],"attempt_id":"487b57440e52e6c28f51c0a2a2eca06231b4857505db98a08dcc0c608b83e5fd:0:1","base":"5f05273e112b6fd9dcc10f42d94bdfc58db58a0c","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"b81eac42c14c3220bfe76133fedbc4a0aa20dbc2","body":"**Block file-input options in the `git grep` and `git ls-files` allowlist.**\n\n`_NO_EXEC` at `cq.py:31` excludes only `-O`, `--op`, `--no-i`, `--tex`, `--ext`, and `--ou`. The `SEARCH_PATTERNS` regex at `cq.py:33` therefore admits `git grep -f /outside/file` and `git ls-files -X /outside/file`. Both options read the named file directly. The guard comment at `cq.py:22-24` says the guard refuses options that leave the repository. These options do leave it. The `.git` and path-containment checks in `src/harness/tools.ts` apply to `read`, `edit`, and `write`. The inspected code does not confine the file arguments of `run` commands.\n\nInvalid pattern lines from the supplied file can appear in `git grep` error output. The `compile_regexp_failed` helper in git v2.43.0 `grep.c` prints the failed pattern text. Secret lines, such as entries from `/etc/shadow`, can therefore reach the model transcript.\n\nReject these options before execution:\n\n<details>\n<summary>🔒 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-_NO_EXEC = (r'(?!.* (?:-[A-Za-z0-9_./:=@%+,^]*O|--op|--no-i|--tex|--ext|--ou))')\n+_NO_EXEC = (r'(?!.* (?:-[A-Za-z0-9_./:=@%+,^]*[OfX]|--op|--no-i|--ex|--ou|--file))')\n```\n\n</details>","id":"dee983c379c7786428ffb552b2e12f61d72e766afc6232984848d8bb193f08ba","intervals":[[31,31]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Block file-input options in the `git grep` and `git ls-files` allowlist."}],"head":"831048b53056e03e30e51d2501c542e1b56dd3ff","head_tree":"43352e314f3c3a14ad68477aef868d1a2c87fd92","input_scope":[{"blob":"b81eac42c14c3220bfe76133fedbc4a0aa20dbc2","intervals":[[1,331]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py"}],"job_id":"487b57440e52e6c28f51c0a2a2eca06231b4857505db98a08dcc0c608b83e5fd:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"b81eac42c14c3220bfe76133fedbc4a0aa20dbc2","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"b81eac42c14c3220bfe76133fedbc4a0aa20dbc2","intervals":[[51,60],[62,71],[207,208],[210,212],[214,215],[315,315],[317,318],[320,321]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair/drivers/cq.py"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":